      "url": "https://www.cartwheelsgymcentre.com/",
      "text": "Cartwheels Gym Centre - Home About Programs Adapted Programs Registration Events Parties Contacts Gymnastic Programs We offer fun and exciting recreational gymnastics classes with our certified qualified coaches. Adapted Programs Inclusive adaptive programming for neurodivergent individuals with special needs, offering 1:1 support. Camps School may be out, but we are just getting warmed up. Cartwheels offers full-day or half day camp options, taking place on select school breaks. Gym Parties A welcoming and exciting place to host your special event. You bring the cake - we take if from there! Welcome to Cartwheels -- Participant Information Memo Welcome to our gym! Cartwheels offer recreational gymnastic instruction in a fun filled, energetic environment. Located in Georgetown Ontario, in a clean professional facility, our qualified coaches are excited to teach your little gymnast! Read more Georgetown’s favourite recreational gymnastics centre News from the gym... Our events Weekly Recreational Gymnastics Classes Music Programming for Littles Special Needs Programming School Break Camps Party Bookings for members of Cartwheels Important News: Stay in the loop: The best way to stay in the loop on all things Cartwheels, is to follow us on social media. You'll find us both on Facebook and Instagram. Not on social media? You can find our most recent Facebook posts in the \"News from the gym\" highlight box here on our website. Facility Expansion: In December 2022, we renovated our 6400 sq/ft facility to a 12,800 sq/ft facility to better meet the needs of our community and add much-needed programs for children with special needs. Cartwheels Awarded Readers' Choice Diamond Best Kids Activities 2022 Diamond Best Gymnastics Club 2021 Platinum Best Family Activities Best Kids Activities Best Kids Camps Best Recreation Facility Best Summer Camps Watch our social media to stay in the know with all things going on at Cartwheels! --> Registration Information: Program Registration: Term 1/Fall registration is Wednesday July 22, 2026 - 8:00am online for all general programming and Tumble n' Learn* - 10:00am by email request for Ability Athletics programs, Playability* and Moveability* *programs registered for an extended period that includes the dates of Term 1 and Term 2. Our Programs Register On-Line Visit our Registration page for information about our discount offers! Contacts Cartwheels Gym Centre 12 Armstrong Ave. Georgetown, ON L7G 4R9 +1 905 702 9904 Email: info@cartwheelsgymcentre.com Cartwheels Gym Centre &copy; Website by Nakoda Creative"
